=== moonbit-crdt ===

[1] G-Counter — disjoint increments merge cleanly
  A = A=3 (value 3)
  B = B=5 (value 5)
  merged = A=3;B=5 (value 8)
  -> no increment is lost, and the merge is order-independent

[2] PN-Counter — increments and decrements coexist
  state = p=A=10|n=A=4
  value = 6 (10 increments - 4 decrements)

[3] OR-Set — concurrent add vs. remove (add wins)
  A adds "lamp"   -> contains: true
  B removes "lamp" -> contains: false
  merged          -> contains: true
  -> the removal could not cancel an addition it never observed

[4] LWW-Register — concurrent writes, deterministic winner
  A writes "light" at t=1000
  B writes "dark"  at t=2000
  merged value = dark
  (the same winner is chosen no matter which side merges first)

Every merge above is commutative, associative and idempotent —
see crdt_test.mbt and the differential harness in tools/.
